<title>UK: BT Effecten sets calls on China Light &amp; Power Co..</title>
<headline>BT Effecten sets calls on China Light &amp; Power Co..</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>BT Effecten has issued 500,000 American-style call warrants, on China Light &amp; Power Co. lead manager Bankers Trust International said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$48.0		   PREMIUM	22.17 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.28 DEM		  GEARING	7.65 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	26.JUN.98		 PAYDATE	11.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFURT, BERLIN, HAMBURG, DUSS, STUTGT</p>
<p> MIN EXER LOT    100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  HK$43.90    DEM/HK$ 22.275</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
